WEBVTT

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>Another new card?</i>

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:34.780
Yes.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:38.040
In the music classroom, 
at Tomoeda Middle School.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.400
<i>What card is it?</i>

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:41.910
It's this.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:45.910
<b>Record</b>

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.920
"Record"... Record.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:51.380
<i>You don't have to get so close. 
Master is right beside you.</i>

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:55.860
Yeah, I know, but it messes 
with my sense of realism...

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:56.930
<i>What does it do?</i>

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.930
I haven't tried it out yet.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.320
But from the look of the card,

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.970
I think it might be able 
to record something...

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:09.900
<i>Nothing happened when you captured it?</i>

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.340
No, I just heard a humming noise.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:16.620
Yes! Fact is stranger than fiction!

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.040
Let's try usin' it, right away!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.400
Isn't "seeing is believing" the 
phrase you're looking for?

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.700
Well, they're basically the same.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.160
<b>Dictionary of Proverbs</b>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.160
I don't think they are...

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:29.410
Anyway!

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.710
In that case, let's set things up, right now!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.500
Set what up?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.830
<i>I will not be joining.</i>

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.820
Why not?! Join us!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.720
<i>Yukito has work. And school, after that.</i>

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.800
Work is fine, but is he really 
takin' part in club stuff?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.570
<i>Yukito is in a Recitation Club, 
which he takes it very seriously.</i>

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:51.360
So that's why Onii-chan...

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.030
What?

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.780
He was picking out books, online.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.680
<i>Contact me if you learn anything.</i>

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:02.620
Grr! He just took off again, 
without sayin' goodbye!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.760
Yue-san has things to do, too.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.750
Yukibunny's the one with things to do!

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.450
Either way, he has a lot more 
things to do than you.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:11.450
How rude!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.740
You ain't got a clue about my 
totally packed schedule!

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:15.850
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:18.700
Well? What are we setting up?

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.550
Oh, right.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.720
Well...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:28.970
<b>Sakura and a Game of Tag in the Garden</b>

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:38.350
I am so honored to receive your request!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:44.360
Well, who better to ask about 
recording than... Tomoyo, yeah?

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.810
Thank you so much!

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.400
Sorry to ask this on our day off.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.870
Did you have things to do?

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:54.060
Not a problem!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:58.760
Filming my adorable Sakura-chan 
takes top priority!

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.580
Besides, it made someone very happy.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:06.950
Come in.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.590
Sakura-chan!

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.090
Hello. I hope you don't min—

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.070
It's been so long! How have you been?

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.140
F-Fine...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.980
You're just as adorable as ever!

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.690
And...

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.160
You look more and more like 
Nadeshiko by the day.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.160
Really?!

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.300
Yes!

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.010
You always had a resemblance,

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.590
but your eyes look even more like hers.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:43.410
Tomoyo told me you were coming 
to try out one of our products.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.460
Yes, the newest one.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:50.640
It's still in the trial stages, but I'd 
love to hear your thoughts.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.050
S-Sure.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.560
Unfortunately, I have a meeting to attend.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:05.410
But I'll be back as soon as I can, 
so make yourself at home.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.280
Thank you. I will.

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:10.150
All right, I'll be going now, Tomoyo.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:11.980
Okay, Mother.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.020
I'll see you soon, Sakura-chan!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.080
Make yourself at home!

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:24.220
Man, my sense of awareness 
never ceases to amaze me.

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:29.210
By the way, Tomoyo-chan, 
what's this new product?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.350
It's...

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.810
Yay!

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.360
How's that?

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:52.080
Yes, it captured you perfectly.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.710
That's really amazing. It's so small,

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.720
but it can take pictures and even fly.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:07.810
Recently, I've missed my last few 
chances to film your efforts.

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:10.360
So I consulted with the people 
who work for my mother,

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.850
and they made their fastest prototype yet.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.730
They made it just for this?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.100
Yes!

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.850
It can be controlled with a smartphone,

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.670
but it's still difficult to make 
finer adjustments...

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.230
So it still has some bugs.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:31.490
Let's save that one.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.780
<b>Saved</b>

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:34.170
Now, then.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:38.400
Why don't we film with this prototype, 
while we try your new card?

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.500
Good idea.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.670
I can just use it right here?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:55.330
I asked to make sure no one else 
would be here, in the garden, today.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:57.320
Let's give it a shot.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:58.540
Okay.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.720
<i>Key that hides the forces of dreams!</i>

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.180
<i>Show me your true form!</i>

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.100
<i>Release!</i>

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:36.920
<i>Record!</i>

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:53.600
Oh?

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.500
It ain't movin'...

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.280
N-No.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:01.230
Is there something else we need to do?

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:02.990
Oh, yeah, maybe!

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:05.490
I bet ya have to order it to do something.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.570
O-Oh, right!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.000
Okay...

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.810
Start recording!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.100
It still ain't movin'.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.670
N-No...

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.640
Maybe you should give it 
more specific directions?

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.390
Like about the exposure or speed.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:33.470
Huh?! But I don't know any 
technical stuff about cameras!

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:37.300
Then, how about just when, where, and what?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.200
Record the area around me!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.750
Did it take pictures?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.620
How do we view them?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.650
Show me what you've recorded!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:21.410
It's better than 3D... It's as though 
there's really another you!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.290
I see. So that's how ya use it.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.300
Ain't this great, Tomoyo?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.420
Kero-chan!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.990
As long as we have this Record card,

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.040
you'll never miss anything again!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:41.940
Huh?

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.070
That's not true, Kero-chan.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.700
It may be true that I'll never miss

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:52.650
Sakura-chan's heroic deeds, now that 
we have this Record card.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.330
But...

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:57.810
Capturing it, with my own hands and eyes,

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:03.180
is the only way I can say I've truly captured 
the real Sakura-chan's cuteness!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.700
Tomoyo-chan?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.700
We must hurry the development 
of this camera even more...

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.970
And of course, one more 
that works underwater!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.590
Underwater?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:18.160
If we do anything underwater, 
we'll need costumes for it.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.510
With oxygen tanks!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:23.620
Yes, you will. And we'll make them the 
cutest oxygen tanks you've ever seen!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:26.050
And don't forget a way to keep 
the masks from fogging up!

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:27.030
Definitely.

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:28.730
How 'bout a costume with fish on it?

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:29.830
That sounds wonderful!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.260
Sorry to interrupt the fun.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.990
Syaoran-kun...

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.590
Heya, kid.

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.620
Sorry I'm late, and that I didn't 
even ask where to go.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:46.260
The person who answered the 
door said you were out here.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:50.730
Not at all. I'm sorry we weren't 
there to welcome you.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.790
Doesn't Sakura-chan look adorable?

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:00.500
This is my best work.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.300
Yeah...

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.960
E-Er, I mean...

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.180
Check this out, kid!

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:09.030
I look pretty awesome, huh?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.180
Look! Check it out!

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:13.500
And this! And this, too!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:14.990
And there, it is!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.370
Thank you so much.

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:35.490
I'm getting to be an old hand

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:39.920
at pretending to be a stuffed animal 
and at hiding when people come by.

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:45.040
These look so good!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:50.140
I had some prepared for you, 
too, so help yourself.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.390
All right! I will!

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:56.130
But first...

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.280
What are you doing?

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:02.260
I'm sendin' pictures to Spinny.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.660
Does he reply?

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.650
No, but I send 'em, anyway. And now...

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.550
Sakura, the cards, too.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:11.780
Right.

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.030
Lay them on the table, in a row.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.010
Okay.

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.440
Facing me.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:20.470
Nice.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.210
I'll snap these, too,

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:25.430
and tell Spinny to show them to Eriol.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.220
Better to have as much info 
to go on as possible, right?

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:31.720
We might actually get a reply.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.940
Kero-chan...

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.860
Thanks!

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.360
And one of the amazing me, too!

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.490
And now, we send...

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.740
Is that the card from this last time?

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:51.490
It really does record things.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:53.900
We were even able to play it back.

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:55.580
I see.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:58.850
It's the first time I've been with 
you when a card appeared,

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:00.340
but I still couldn't...

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:03.970
You didn't feel anything, right?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.180
No.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.330
Kero-chan and Yue-san can't, either.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.090
What could that mean?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.590
What about the dreams?

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.550
I still don't understand them...

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:22.820
I'm standing there, with someone 
who's around the same height as me.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.060
And then, there's a sound.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.990
A sound?

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:28.900
Yeah.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:33.920
At first, it sounded like breaking glass.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:38.070
But now, it sounds like a clock's ticking.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:45.070
And there are huge gears and clock hands...

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:51.840
But...

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.920
I hope it's not something that 
will cause trouble for everyone.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:13:59.760
Huh?

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.590
Something just...

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.610
The wind?

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.330
Is that what it was?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.920
There it is!

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.920
That wasn't just the wind.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:18.660
There was something, 
like the edge of a cloth...

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:25.200
I still can't see anything.

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:29.590
Is that it?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.170
Yeah!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:35.230
It's definitely no ordinary wind!

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:52.330
When did ya learn to use 
a technique like that?!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.450
<i>Thunder god, come forth!</i>

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.130
It dodged...

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:11.770
Where is it?

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.280
Wait!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.620
Sakura-chan!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:28.110
Sakura!

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.630
<i>Release!</i>

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.770
<i>Gravitation!</i>

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:02.030
<i>Gravitation!</i>

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.010
Wait!

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.200
<i>Wind? If it's wind, Gale could...</i>

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.510
<i>No, that would hurt it.</i>

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:06.840
<i>Action!</i>

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.260
<i>Then, I'll use Siege to...</i>

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.630
<i>No.</i>

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.580
<i>It's...</i>

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:05.200
<i>I shouldn't capture it by force.</i>

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:10.220
<i>Be more...</i>

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.960
<i>More...</i>

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:24.640
<i>Yes, more...</i>

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.880
More friendly.

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.380
You'll be my friend?

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.520
Thank you!

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:55.700
<i>Force without master,</i>

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:59.620
<i>heed the call of my Staff of Dreams, 
and become my power.</i>

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:01.270
<i>Secure!</i>

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.260
<b>Flight</b>

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.310
"Flight"...

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.290
Flight.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.550
I'm so glad we're friends now!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.680
Sakura!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:39.700
I-It really is...

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:44.110
better to always... be prepared!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.720
Are you okay, Tomoyo-chan?

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:48.890
You okay?

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:57.080
Tomoyo's persistence really is what produces
one masterpiece after another. Uh-huh.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.540
I'm sorry that I worried you.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.630
Are you sure you're okay?

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.030
I feel fine now.

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:13.290
Besides, a more important matter is at hand.

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:18.350
I need to see you use your 
new card, right away!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.350
You also want to see it, don't you, Li-kun?

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.790
Uh, yeah...

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.450
Er, I mean...

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:31.280
I do want to know what the new card is.

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:32.790
Only the card?!

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:35.540
Huh? No, I didn't mean—

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:36.390
What's wrong with you?!

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:42.630
If Yue were here, he'd slug 
this kid a good one.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:46.070
Sakura-chan, please go ahead.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.350
O-Okay.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:54.370
Everything is ready!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.350
<i>Flight!</i>

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.830
That's awesome, Sakura!

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:25.380
It really does make ya fly!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.260
Yeah!

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:34.290
This is great! I can move however I want!

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:40.380
It's pretty amazing how Tomoyo's 
camera follows you, too!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.190
Yeah.

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.570
This card, and all the other new cards...

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:31.820
I hope they'll be things that 
make everyone happy.

00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:12.110
Hidey-howdy-ho!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:12.970
<b>Leave It to Kero-chan!</b>

00:24:12.960 --> 00:24:17.080
We're back with "Leave It to Kero-chan," 
or "Leave Kero" for short!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.720
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.720
<b>K</b>

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:16.720
<b>Don't shorten it!</b>

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:21.480
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:21.480
<b>K</b>

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.420
Today, we're looking at... Yes, this!

00:24:19.420 --> 00:24:21.860
Sakura's new key and staff!

00:24:21.860 --> 00:24:24.610
This mysterious key came 
to Sakura in a dream.

00:24:24.610 --> 00:24:26.500
She wears it as a pendant.

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:27.930
This is how it looks as a staff.

00:24:27.930 --> 00:24:30.520
Ain't it pretty, with that 
shiny star in the center?

